<title>UK: Allgemeine Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark Feb 2006 bond.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark Feb 2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BZW, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    01.FEB.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   S-6.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+7 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
</text>
